"<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" bgcolor=\"#ff2e2e\" style=\"background-color:#ff2e2e;width:100%;\">\n<tr><td align=\"center\" bgcolor=\"#ff2e2e\" style=\"background-color:#ff2e2e;padding:20px 10px 36px 10px;\">\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"width:100%;max-width:560px;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;color:#1a1a1a;\">\n\n<!-- logo -->\n<tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:0 0 16px 0;\">\n<table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" bgcolor=\"#f4f0e6\" style=\"background-color:#f4f0e6;border:3px solid #1a1a1a;border-bottom:8px solid #1a1a1a;border-radius:4px;\"><tr><td style=\"padding:4px 10px;\"><img src=\"https://yumloop.net/mail/header-compact.png\" width=\"330\" alt=\"SIGHTLINE · Logic Puzzle\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:330px;height:auto;border:0;font-size:24px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:.3em;color:#1a1a1a;text-align:center;\"></td></tr></table>\n</td></tr>\n\n<!-- SIGHTLINE: the trailer first -->\n<tr><td>\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" bgcolor=\"#ffffff\" style=\"background-color:#ffffff;border:3px solid #1a1a1a;border-bottom:8px solid #1a1a1a;border-radius:4px;\">\n<tr><td bgcolor=\"#0040f7\" style=\"background-color:#0040f7;padding:9px 18px;border-bottom:3px solid #1a1a1a;font-size:12px;line-height:16px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#ffffff;\"><span style=\"color:#ffffff;\">Sightline &nbsp;&middot;&nbsp; Logic puzzle</span></td></tr>\n<tr><td><a href=\"https://yumloop.net/sightline-pitch#trailer\" style=\"text-decoration:none;\"><img src=\"https://yumloop.net/mail/sightline-portals.gif\" width=\"554\" alt=\"Sightline gameplay: sightlines running through portals\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:554px;height:auto;border:0;border-bottom:3px solid #1a1a1a;\"></a></td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:16px 18px 18px 18px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.55;color:#1a1a1a;\">\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 6px 0;font-size:22px;line-height:1.25;font-weight:bold;color:#1a1a1a;\">Every clue has a point of view.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 14px 0;\">Walls block lines of sight, mirrors bend them and portals carry them across the board. Every level is solved by logic alone, never a guess.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0;line-height:1;\">\n<a href=\"https://yumloop.net/sightline-pitch#trailer\" style=\"display:inline-block;margin:0 8px 10px 0;padding:11px 16px;background-color:#ff7a00;border:3px solid #1a1a1a;border-bottom:6px solid #1a1a1a;border-radius:4px;font-size:15px;line-height:19px;font-weight:bold;color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;white-space:nowrap;\"><span style=\"color:#ffffff;\">&#9654;&nbsp; Watch the trailer</span></a><a href=\"https://yumloop.net/sightline-pitch#builds\" style=\"display:inline-block;margin:0 8px 10px 0;padding:11px 16px;background-color:#ffffff;border:3px solid #1a1a1a;border-bottom:6px solid #1a1a1a;border-radius:4px;font-size:15px;line-height:19px;font-weight:bold;color:#1a1a1a;text-decoration:none;white-space:nowrap;\"><span style=\"color:#1a1a1a;\">Get the builds</span></a><a href=\"https://yumloop.net/sightline-pitch\" style=\"display:inline-block;margin:0 8px 10px 0;padding:11px 16px;background-color:#ffffff;border:3px solid #1a1a1a;border-bottom:6px solid #1a1a1a;border-radius:4px;font-size:15px;line-height:19px;font-weight:bold;color:#1a1a1a;text-decoration:none;white-space:nowrap;\"><span style=\"color:#1a1a1a;\">Full pitch</span></a>\n</p>\n</td></tr></table>\n</td></tr>\n\n<tr><td height=\"16\" style=\"height:16px;font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</td></tr>\n\n<!-- the note -->\n<tr><td bgcolor=\"#ffffff\" style=\"background-color:#ffffff;border:3px solid #1a1a1a;border-bottom:8px solid #1a1a1a;border-radius:4px;padding:18px 20px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:#1a1a1a;\">\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 10px 0;\">Hi,</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 10px 0;\">I’m Yoni, a former Rockstar Games designer and founder of Yumloop Games, an independent Scottish studio.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0;\"><b>Sightline</b> is finished and playable today, with a second complete game, <b>Sightline 3D</b>, beside it. I’m looking for a publishing partner for launch on Steam and mobile, with Switch also possible.</p>\n</td></tr>\n\n<tr><td height=\"16\" style=\"height:16px;font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</td></tr>\n\n<!-- the numbers -->\n<tr><td>\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" bgcolor=\"#ffffff\" style=\"background-color:#ffffff;border:3px solid #1a1a1a;border-bottom:8px solid #1a1a1a;border-radius:4px;\">\n<tr>\n<td width=\"25%\" align=\"center\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:25%;padding:12px 4px;border-right:2px solid #1a1a1a;\"><span style=\"display:block;font-size:26px;line-height:1.1;font-weight:bold;color:#0040f7;\">700</span><span style=\"display:block;font-size:11px;line-height:1.3;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#1a1a1a;\">Levels</span></td>\n<td width=\"25%\" align=\"center\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:25%;padding:12px 4px;border-right:2px solid #1a1a1a;\"><span style=\"display:block;font-size:26px;line-height:1.1;font-weight:bold;color:#0eb14a;\">16</span><span style=\"display:block;font-size:11px;line-height:1.3;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#1a1a1a;\">Player crossplay</span></td>\n<td width=\"25%\" align=\"center\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:25%;padding:12px 4px;border-right:2px solid #1a1a1a;\"><span style=\"display:block;font-size:26px;line-height:1.1;font-weight:bold;color:#a040d8;\">6</span><span style=\"display:block;font-size:11px;line-height:1.3;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#1a1a1a;\">Platforms</span></td>\n<td width=\"25%\" align=\"center\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:25%;padding:12px 4px;\"><span style=\"display:block;font-size:26px;line-height:1.1;font-weight:bold;color:#ff2e2e;\">0</span><span style=\"display:block;font-size:11px;line-height:1.3;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#1a1a1a;\">Guesses</span></td>\n</tr></table>\n</td></tr>\n\n<tr><td height=\"16\" style=\"height:16px;font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</td></tr>\n\n<!-- SIGHTLINE 3D -->\n<tr><td>\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" bgcolor=\"#ffffff\" style=\"background-color:#ffffff;border:3px solid #1a1a1a;border-bottom:8px solid #1a1a1a;border-radius:4px;\">\n<tr><td bgcolor=\"#a040d8\" style=\"background-color:#a040d8;padding:9px 18px;border-bottom:3px solid #1a1a1a;font-size:12px;line-height:16px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#ffffff;\"><span style=\"color:#ffffff;\">Also complete &nbsp;&middot;&nbsp; Sightline 3D</span></td></tr>\n<tr><td><a href=\"https://yumloop.net/sightline3d-pitch#trailer\" style=\"text-decoration:none;\"><img src=\"https://yumloop.net/mail/sightline3d-hero-480.gif\" width=\"554\" alt=\"Sightline 3D gameplay: a sightline wrapping round a cube\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:554px;height:auto;border:0;border-bottom:3px solid #1a1a1a;\"></a></td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:16px 18px 18px 18px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.55;color:#1a1a1a;\">\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 6px 0;font-size:22px;line-height:1.25;font-weight:bold;color:#1a1a1a;\">Then the board folds.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 14px 0;\">The same deduction on solid shapes: sightlines run over the edges, buttons turn whole rows and portals link floating islands. 401 levels and its own 16-player mode.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0;line-height:1;\">\n<a href=\"https://yumloop.net/sightline3d-pitch#trailer\" style=\"display:inline-block;margin:0 8px 10px 0;padding:11px 16px;background-color:#ff7a00;border:3px solid #1a1a1a;border-bottom:6px solid #1a1a1a;border-radius:4px;font-size:15px;line-height:19px;font-weight:bold;color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;white-space:nowrap;\"><span style=\"color:#ffffff;\">&#9654;&nbsp; Watch the trailer</span></a><a href=\"https://yumloop.net/sightline3d-pitch#builds\" style=\"display:inline-block;margin:0 8px 10px 0;padding:11px 16px;background-color:#ffffff;border:3px solid #1a1a1a;border-bottom:6px solid #1a1a1a;border-radius:4px;font-size:15px;line-height:19px;font-weight:bold;color:#1a1a1a;text-decoration:none;white-space:nowrap;\"><span style=\"color:#1a1a1a;\">Get the builds</span></a><a href=\"https://yumloop.net/sightline3d-pitch\" style=\"display:inline-block;margin:0 8px 10px 0;padding:11px 16px;background-color:#ffffff;border:3px solid #1a1a1a;border-bottom:6px solid #1a1a1a;border-radius:4px;font-size:15px;line-height:19px;font-weight:bold;color:#1a1a1a;text-decoration:none;white-space:nowrap;\"><span style=\"color:#1a1a1a;\">Full pitch</span></a>\n</p>\n</td></tr></table>\n</td></tr>\n\n<tr><td height=\"16\" style=\"height:16px;font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</td></tr>\n\n<!-- BOTH GAMES: EVERY SCREEN (one of each device) -->\n<tr><td>\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" bgcolor=\"#ffffff\" style=\"background-color:#ffffff;border:3px solid #1a1a1a;border-bottom:8px solid #1a1a1a;border-radius:4px;\">\n<tr><td bgcolor=\"#0eb14a\" style=\"background-color:#0eb14a;padding:9px 18px;border-bottom:3px solid #1a1a1a;font-size:12px;line-height:16px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#ffffff;\"><span style=\"color:#ffffff;\">Both games &nbsp;&middot;&nbsp; Every screen</span></td></tr>\n<tr><td bgcolor=\"#f3f0e8\" style=\"background-color:#f3f0e8;padding:10px 0 8px 0;border-bottom:3px solid #1a1a1a;\"><img src=\"https://yumloop.net/mail/devices-both.gif\" width=\"554\" alt=\"Sightline on iPhone, Sightline 3D on Steam Deck, and a Sightline box mock-up for Nintendo Switch\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:554px;height:auto;border:0;\"></td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:16px 18px 18px 18px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.55;color:#1a1a1a;\">\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 12px 0;\">Both games run on all of these today, each with its own layout and controls, cross-play multiplayer, cross-save and leaderboards. A <b>Nintendo Switch</b> port is also possible.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 12px 0;line-height:2;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;border:2px solid #1a1a1a;border-radius:3px;padding:4px 8px;margin:0 6px 6px 0;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;white-space:nowrap;\">&#10003; iPhone &amp; iPad</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;border:2px solid #1a1a1a;border-radius:3px;padding:4px 8px;margin:0 6px 6px 0;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;white-space:nowrap;\">&#10003; Android</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;border:2px solid #1a1a1a;border-radius:3px;padding:4px 8px;margin:0 6px 6px 0;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;white-space:nowrap;\">&#10003; Windows</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;border:2px solid #1a1a1a;border-radius:3px;padding:4px 8px;margin:0 6px 6px 0;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;white-space:nowrap;\">&#10003; Mac</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;border:2px solid #1a1a1a;border-radius:3px;padding:4px 8px;margin:0 6px 6px 0;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;white-space:nowrap;\">&#10003; Steam Deck</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;border:2px dashed #1a1a1a;border-radius:3px;padding:4px 8px;margin:0 6px 6px 0;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;white-space:nowrap;\">+ Switch port possible</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin:0;\">Desktop builds download straight from each pitch page; iPhone, Android and Steam access takes one reply.</p>\n</td></tr></table>\n</td></tr>\n\n<tr><td height=\"16\" style=\"height:16px;font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</td></tr>\n\n<!-- close -->\n<tr><td bgcolor=\"#1a1a1a\" style=\"background-color:#1a1a1a;border:3px solid #1a1a1a;border-radius:4px;padding:18px 20px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:#ffffff;\">\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 10px 0;color:#ffffff;\">Happy to set you up on TestFlight, Android or a Steam key, and to talk about either game or both.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0;color:#ffffff;\"><b style=\"color:#ffffff;\">Would a short call work for you?</b></p>\n</td></tr>\n\n<tr><td style=\"padding:18px 4px 0 4px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.55;color:#ffffff;\">\n<span style=\"font-size:17px;font-weight:bold;color:#ffffff;\">Yoni</span><br>\n<span style=\"color:#ffffff;\">Founder, Yumloop Games</span><br>\n<a href=\"mailto:yoni@yumloop.net\" style=\"color:#ffffff;font-weight:bold;text-decoration:underline;\">yoni@yumloop.net</a> &nbsp;&middot;&nbsp; <a href=\"https://yumloop.net\" style=\"color:#ffffff;font-weight:bold;text-decoration:underline;\">yumloop.net</a>\n</td></tr>\n\n</table>\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n"